{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-alerts-phone-tracker-lib-b-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-4","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-lib","refs":["F-phone-1114","FN-B-alerts-panel-screens-1-b-02"],"severity":"S2","title":"A member who once deleted a gym plan folder is still told 'Your gym changed your workout plan, tap to see it', but the changed plan never comes back to the phone","what":"When a member deletes a folder the gym sent, the phone remembers that plan and never makes the folder again, even when the trainer later changes the plan. The server still sends the member the pop-up 'Your gym changed your workout plan: name. Tap to see it on the Workout tab.' The member taps it and finds nothing. The trainer believes the new plan reached them, and nothing on the phone or the desk says it was skipped or why. Only Erase all data clears the memory.","expected":"A changed plan either comes back (a new version brings the folder back, or the Workout tab offers 'Your gym updated a plan you deleted: Get it'), or the pop-up is not sent to a member whose phone will skip it, and the desk can see the member removed the plan.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/lib/gymPlanSteps.ts:28-47","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/gymPlansSync.ts:37-38","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/gymPlansSync.ts:108-122","supabase/migrations/0073_member_push_more.sql:120-134"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"deleted-gym-plan-never-returns","who":"members of gyms that send workout plans, and their trainers","how_often":"every plan change after the member deleted that folder once","fix_line":"Let a new version of a plan bring its folder back (or offer it on the Workout tab), and tell the desk when a member removed a plan","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
